<p><strong>Identifying when the current node is the LCA of p and q</strong>=
<br>
Let=E2=80=99s identify where in the subtree p and q should be to qualify no=
de 3 as the <em>lowest</em> ancestor of them both.</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
